source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A heading's own content is not a line start: a bare marker run after `h1.` stays text.
-- input.jira --
h1. * item
-- rendered.html --
<h1><a name="item"></a>* item</h1>
-- want.md --
# \* item
-- warnings.json --
[]
